    {
      "id": "55_Gw0YDHVFz3PkldvOXz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 763.453125,
      "y": 339.65625,
      "width": 482.1279602050781,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 344678301,
      "version": 570,
      "versionNonce": 49247347,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777234846491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Low latency - Application should be able to start\nshowing feeds in very less time, and feeds should not buffer\n\n2. High Availability : Target around 99.99% uptime\n\n3. Eventual Consistency : Its okay to show slightly outdated\nlikes and comments at the cost of highly available and be \neventually consistent\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Low latency - Application should be able to start\nshowing feeds in very less time, and feeds should not buffer\n\n2. High Availability : Target around 99.99% uptime\n\n3. Eventual Consistency : Its okay to show slightly outdated\nlikes and comments at the cost of highly available and be \neventually consistent\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "47P6xz8kYzOJ8EnuSPMKL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 293.5390625,
      "y": 577.8515625,
      "width": 772.3681030273438,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1116788339,
      "version": 901,
      "versionNonce": 2101772349,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777234846491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. There are around 1B active users / day\n2. An average user watches around 200 videos per day, thus Total Views per day = 200B views\n3. Storage estimates : \nSize of 1 video, raw : 10MB\nApprox 2% of the users upload 1 video per day, thus\nPer day storage = 20M * 10MB = 200 TB\nNow 1 video will be stored across minimum 5 formats thus : 200 TB * 5 = 1 PB of storage per day\n4. Egress bandwidth : \n200 B views * 10 MB (per view) = 2 Exabytes of egress bandwidth per day.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. There are around 1B active users / day\n2. An average user watches around 200 videos per day, thus Total Views per day = 200B views\n3. Storage estimates : \nSize of 1 video, raw : 10MB\nApprox 2% of the users upload 1 video per day, thus\nPer day storage = 20M * 10MB = 200 TB\nNow 1 video will be stored across minimum 5 formats thus : 200 TB * 5 = 1 PB of storage per day\n4. Egress bandwidth : \n200 B views * 10 MB (per view) = 2 Exabytes of egress bandwidth per day.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
