      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777235550481,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We have around 10M users, so we can use a Redis ZSet entry to hold the data.\nThe size of the above is very small, around 100 bytes.\n100 bytes with : 10M * 100 bytes =1,000 m·byte = 1 - 2GB, which can fit easily in memory\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We have around 10M users, so we can use a Redis ZSet entry to hold the data.\nThe size of the above is very small, around 100 bytes.\n100 bytes with : 10M * 100 bytes =1,000 m·byte = 1 - 2GB, which can fit easily in memory\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
